# What `mytest --compiler` expects where a fixture's directory does not say it
# all: succeed/, warn/ and generic_cases/ compile, fail/ is rejected, and
# syntax_check/ and token/ parse. Fixtures are relative to this directory.
#
# error|fixture|text            rejected with the text in the output: by mlc in
#                               generic_cases/, by the syntax checker in
#                               syntax_check/ and token/
# skip|fixture                  a parked example, kept in the tree but not run
# profile|file name|text        mlc compiles a source of that name and reports
#                               the text
# profile-error|file name|text  mlc refuses a source of that name with the text
#
# A profile case compiles `i32 main() { return 0; }` unless a fourth field gives
# the source.

error|generic_cases/wrong_call_type.mln|argument type mismatch
error|generic_cases/wrong_body_type.mln|return type mismatch
error|generic_cases/wrong_call_arity.mln|error[E0101]
error|generic_cases/prototype_only.mln|requires a definition in this module
error|generic_cases/ordinary_type_arguments.mln|generic declaration is not available
error|generic_cases/recursive_value.mln|infinite size
error|generic_cases/recursive_value_array.mln|infinite size
error|generic_cases/expanding_function.mln|instantiation limit exceeded
error|generic_cases/expanding_type.mln|instantiation limit exceeded
error|generic_cases/reference_wrapping.mln|cannot wrap a reference type argument
error|generic_cases/reserved_symbol.mln|prefix is reserved

error|syntax_check/missing_initializer_expression.mln|Expected expression before ';'.
error|syntax_check/missing_if_condition.mln|Expected expression before ')'.
error|syntax_check/ternary_without_else.mln|Expected expression before ';'.
error|syntax_check/case_key_syntax_error.mln|Expected expression before '->'.
error|token/tokens_present_on_error.mln|

# Parked examples, not cases from the retired Python matrix: the compiler
# accepts their current forms.
skip|fail/semantic/payloadEnumNestedAmbiguous_fail.mln
skip|fail/struct/byvalArgNonAddressable_fail.mln
skip|fail/struct/byvalReturnNonAddressable_fail.mln

profile|main.mln|syntax=core, safety=checked
profile|main.unsafe.mln|syntax=core, safety=unsafe
profile|page.dom.mln|syntax=dom, safety=checked
profile|page.dom.unsafe.mln|syntax=dom, safety=unsafe
profile|schema.contract.mln|syntax=core, safety=checked
profile|schema.unsafe.contract.mln|syntax=core, safety=unsafe
profile|serial.test.mln|syntax=core, safety=checked
profile|serial.unsafe.test.mln|syntax=core, safety=unsafe
profile|page.dom.test.mln|syntax=dom, safety=checked
profile-error|page.mlx|expected a canonical .mln filename
profile-error|page.web.mln|unknown source modifier 'web'
profile-error|page.dom.dom.mln|duplicate source modifier 'dom'
profile-error|page.unsafe.unsafe.mln|duplicate source modifier 'unsafe'
profile-error|page.unsafe.dom.mln|must precede semantic policy modifiers
profile-error|schema.contract.unsafe.mln|contract source modifier 'unsafe' must be last
profile-error|page.safe.mln|unknown source modifier 'safe'
profile-error|schema.contract.test.mln|contract source modifier 'test' must be last
profile-error|page.test.dom.mln|test source modifier 'dom' must be last
profile-error|page..mln|empty modifier
profile-error|page.mln|DOM syntax requires a canonical .dom.mln filename|DomNode* build() { return <Window/>; }
